{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL0RlbGljYXRlJTIwU3RhdGUlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Delicate State","description":"Shot over the course of their actual pregnancy with cast doubling as 2-man crew, Paula and Charlie document their impending parenthood during a time of extreme political division. Their heads remain in the sand about the greater world around them until it upends their privileged life. Now they face a situation Instagram never prepared them for, but that women all over the world face daily - bringing life into a country torn apart by war.\n\nReleased 4 Jan 2022 · US · Language: English · 89 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5MB6xoh2JKteL76KM1u5JDuUv52.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cKdyvgtK6LqbhItZq5AbRTfKQEG.jpg","runtime":"89 min","cast":["Paula Rhodes","Charlie Bodin","Glenn Morshower","Cathy Baron","Charles Halford","Tara Platt","Jonathan Kells Phillips","Dee Freeman"],"director":["Paula Rhodes"],"released":"2022-01-04T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"They were expecting a child, but not a Civil War.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Paula Rhodes","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5rAzHgexeqNwcj1u4q6hBE2VeKT.jpg"},{"name":"Paula Rhodes","character":"Paula","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5rAzHgexeqNwcj1u4q6hBE2VeKT.jpg"},{"name":"Charlie Bodin","character":"Charlie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r2i924tn0GJxUVZyNOwXlf1gASu.jpg"},{"name":"Glenn Morshower","character":"Glenn","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/SjgNUSLoBAVossDI4QkNtDxYDZ.jpg"},{"name":"Cathy Baron","character":"Cathy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/siYHI1cPbCKnURy6vDwIYIMLbIn.jpg"},{"name":"Charles Halford","character":"Halford","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mrCy6dA5AHqczA4aJX4drCQ3tjC.jpg"},{"name":"Tara Platt","character":"Nurse Plat